{"asset_key":"ep3/herohub_story_13411060","episode":"ep3","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"13411060","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1341106001:1":{"text":"真没想到，白山的活死人竟然是死神大人为了对抗恶魔而创造的亡灵战士。","source_cn":"真没想到，白山的活死人竟然是死神大人为了对抗恶魔而创造...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4EDD2AF443CBAD5A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1341106002:1":{"text":"两千年过去，连活死人自己都将他们的过去遗忘了。但还好，你们找回了他们的故事，为他们正名……他们是守护者，是真正的英雄。","source_cn":"两千年过去，连活死人自己都将他们的过去遗忘了。但还好，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD928BABA3E43D959","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1341106003:1":{"text":"那么，法拉莫尔先生还是觉得亡灵的存在有悖于自然秩序吗？","source_cn":"那么，法拉莫尔先生还是觉得亡灵的存在有悖于自然秩序吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B8BB539EC2027D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1341106004:1":{"text":"谁知道呢……也许亡灵天生就藏在自然秩序的阴影中。而光与影，都该是自然的一部分。","source_cn":"谁知道呢……也许亡灵天生就藏在自然秩序的阴影中。而光与...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA19318909160C8C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1341106005:1":{"text":"阴影并不代表罪恶。","source_cn":"阴影并不代表罪恶。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF93F220A6F47FACD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1341106005":{"text":"阴影并不代表罪恶。","source_cn":"阴影并不代表罪恶。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF93F220A6F47FACD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1341106006:1":{"text":"我知道你们想问什么，我的答案是……会。我会继续做亡灵猎人，追逐为非作歹的亡灵，不让失去理智的活死人伤害人们。","source_cn":"我知道你们想问什么，我的答案是……会。我会继续做亡灵猎...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x92DA6811A25ED914","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1341106007:1":{"text":"但我也想认识一些不一样的亡灵。或许有一天，我会和几位亡灵成为无话不说的好朋友，谁知道呢？","source_cn":"但我也想认识一些不一样的亡灵。或许有一天，我会和几位亡...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3581DFFB76AE4A27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1341106008:1":{"text":"哈哈，希望我有更多的机会了解他们。","source_cn":"哈哈，希望我有更多的机会了解他们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF2806490443692B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1341106009:1":{"text":"法拉莫尔先生，你接下来有什么打算？","source_cn":"法拉莫尔先生，你接下来有什么打算？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6330F0B54C379BF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:13411060